stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Cold: healthCheck configured
  [*] --> Eligible: no healthCheck (passive only)
  Cold --> Eligible: rise consecutive probe successes
  Eligible --> Down: fall consecutive probe failures
  Eligible --> Broken: 3 consecutive dial failures (passive breaker)
  Broken --> Eligible: successful dial
  Down --> Eligible: rise successes (no user traffic needed)
  note right of Cold
    ineligible until the rise
    threshold is met
  end note
  note right of Down
    all peers ineligible → 503
  end note
